<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR WEDNESDAY.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR WEDNESDAY.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev for Wednesday:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,564.20 (1,570.20)	CHF  1,061.60 (1,071.60)</p>
<p>    DEM    912.98 (919.86)	  GBP  2,534.50 (2,553.60)</p>
<p>    ATS    129.69 (130.99)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Tuesday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought   $40.93 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold     $23.93 million</p>
<p>Total turnover $64.86 million ($63.76 million) -- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569; 981 4145</p>
